<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia sets A$250 mln indexed bond tender.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia sets A$250 mln indexed bond tender.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Treasury said it will offer A$250 million of 4.0 percent August 2020 indexed bonds at a tender on Thursday.</p>
<p>It is the first time the stock has been issued.</p>
<p>The Reserve Bank said it would take up A$20 million of the bonds for its own portfolio.</p>
<p>Bids are due at 12.45 p.m. (0145 GMT) and the result will be announced at 2.00 p.m. (0300 GMT).</p>
<p>Settlement date is October 14.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
